    "message": "[{\"projectQuestion\":\"Contact Name\",\"projectAnswer\":\"Jonathan Morgan\"},{\"projectQuestion\":\"Project Location\",\"projectAnswer\":\"Centerville, TX 75833\"},{\"projectQuestion\":\"Message\",\"projectAnswer\":\"Estimating projects \\In House\\ can be time-consuming and expensive. Let Bidding Solutions LLC take that burden off your plate. We offer accurate residential and commercial estimates, material takeoffs, and scheduling services for Contractors.\\n\\nOur professional team includes cost consultants, estimators, quantity surveyors, schedulers, and trade experts across all CSI Divisions. We use leading software tools like Bluebeam, PlanSwift, On-Screen Takeoff, Accubid, and Xactimate to ensure precision. All pricing is adjusted per ZIP code using up-to-date local vendor data and RS Means. \\n\\nOur charges are $250\\u2013$350 for a single trade project and $550-$650 for a full scope project. We are offering a 50% discount on all estimates until the Christmas and New Year season. \\n\\nPlease send over project plans, and we\\u2019ll respond with a free Quote detailing our pricing and a 2\\u20133 business day turnaround time.\\n\\nBidding Solutions LLC is a registered company and your trusted partner in professional cost estimation. Feel free to request sample estimates, or visit our website: https:\\/\\/biddingsolutionllc.com\\/\"}]"
